# MissionControl: 3 foot windows on space 1 (A,B,C), one on space 2 (D). Both looks.
# Earlier results: Glass open/close in Rust was slower than QML (0.50-1.15 s vs 0.34 s open; 0.55-0.79 s vs 0.20 s close), card bar about 6 px lower (fixed in round 2), accent red vs orange, dock icons monochrome.
setup foot -T A & sleep 1; foot -T B & sleep 1; foot -T C & sleep 1; hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.workspace(2)'; sleep 1; foot -T D & sleep 1; hyprctl dispatch 'hl.dsp.workspace(1)'
wait 6
ptr move 100 900
rec mc-open 1.2 ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
note Open takes 320 ms (emphasized in): bar slides 30 px down while fading, stage scales 0.96 -> 1. Rust Glass was slower than QML before: first change and duration must match QML within 1-2 frames.
wait 1
shot open
note Mission Control: space cards 150x84 centred at y 86 (x 628, 794, 960, 1126, 1292 with 5 spaces), titles y about 134, window tiles side by side below (stage from y 189). Card bar not 6 px lower than QML; accent ring colour same as QML (orange, not red); dock icons coloured (not monochrome).
ptr move 960 560 sleep 200 glide 960 560 400 sleep 400
shot hover-window
note Hovered window: card grows 1.02 over 150 ms with a 3 px accent border; Glass: title pill appears under it; Material: the chip turns secondaryContainer. Same as QML.
ptr move 960 560 sleep 200 glide 1600 900 300 sleep 400
shot hover-off
note Pointer moved off: hover state back to normal (no border, no pill).
rec mc-close 1.2 ipc panels close
note Close takes 320 ms (exit curve); compare with QML (Glass QML was about 0.20 s first change).
wait 1
ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ptr move 960 560 sleep 200 click
wait 1
shot click-window
note Clicking a window focuses it and closes Mission Control.
ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 794 86 sleep 200 click
wait 1
shot click-card
note Click on card 2: space 2 shown, Mission Control STAYS open showing only window D.
ptr move 794 134 sleep 200 click
wait 1
shot click-title
note Click on the title under card 2 (794, 134): Mission Control CLOSES (title is not part of the card's click area), same as QML.
ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1126 86 sleep 200 down glide 794 86 600 sleep 200
shot drag-card
note While dragging card 4 over card 2: dragged card follows the pointer at 85 % opacity and card 2 is marked as drop target. Same as QML.
ptr move 1126 86 sleep 200 down glide 794 86 600 sleep 200 up
wait 1
shot drag-drop
note After the drop the cards are reordered (titles swap order); a small move under 8 px then release counts as a click instead. Same as QML.
key -k Escape
wait 1
shot esc
note Escape closes Mission Control.
ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 960 1060 sleep 200 click
wait 1
shot bg-click
note Clicking the background at (960, 1060) closes Mission Control.
ipc panels exposeApp foot
wait 1
shot expose
note Expose: header "foot" + "4 windows" and all four foot windows (D from space 2 too). Earlier run: NEITHER shell showed the header; if the header is missing in both it is not a Rust difference.
ipc panels close
wait 1
setup hyprctl dispatch workspace 3
wait 1
ipc panels open missionControl TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
shot empty
note Empty space 3: "No windows on this desktop" centred in the stage, same as QML; dock icons coloured on Rust too.
ipc panels close
# MANUAL: record 2 s with the pointer still over a window: no flicker of hover border / title pill, picture never blanks; region-changes.py over a card in the bar shows no change (tool not in the DSL)
